   "subject": "Poppr version 2.9.0 is officially on CRAN",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<br>Hello friends,<br><br>Poppr version 2.9.0 is now on CRAN and should be built for Windows and MacOS within the next couple of days.<br><div><br></div><div><font size=\"5\"><b>Installation</b></font><br></div><div>You can install the new version from the <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125484000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WSPkkjXoBJhK53uOdN-dA\">R-universe</a> or <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/package=poppr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/package%3Dpoppr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125484000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bN5pG2rNTAViQbRIQNhsg\">CRAN</a> via:</div><div><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>options<span>(</span>repos <span>=</span> c<span>(</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>  grunwaldlab <span>=</span> <span>&#39;<a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125485000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PIM_jK_pCIOrcmMNzzMgZ\">https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev</a>&#39;</span><span>,</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>  CRAN <span>=</span> <span>&#39;<a href=\"https://cloud.r-project.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cloud.r-project.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125485000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3N3iqo--xtxSBLKi8EJNtm\">https://cloud.r-project.org</a>&#39;</span><span>)</span><span><br></span></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span><span>)</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>\r\ninstall.packages<span>(</span><span>&#39;poppr&#39;</span><span>)</span></span></span></b></div><div><br></div><div>Note: the R-universe is a new platform and will contain the most up-to-date version of poppr in case the one on CRAN gets bumped off.<br><br></div><div><font size=\"5\"><b>What&#39;s New?</b></font></div>This version contains a new function called `bruvo.between()` from David Folarian that compares individuals to a reference set. <br><br>There are also a couple of important bugfixes to genind2genalex() for SNP data and bitwise.ia() for large sample sizes on Windows.<br><br><div>Full details of the release can be seen here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125485000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3eoQO_wBOg0GbJQPiEdDLx\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0</a></div><div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>Zhian N. Kamvar<br></div><br><br><br>"
    ]
   ]
  },
