   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "One more thing to note: The vignettes will no longer be available through the binary package, but they will still be available at <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.github.io/poppr/articles/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.github.io/poppr/articles/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vX37CHGa7lv_tMAeddGoL\">https://grunwaldlab.github.io/poppr/articles/</a>"
    ],
