     "<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Saturday, February 6, 2021 at 3:43:25 PM UTC-8 poppr wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><br>Hello friends,<br><br>Poppr version 2.9.0 is now on CRAN and should be built for Windows and MacOS within the next couple of days.<br><div><br></div><div><font size=\"5\"><b>Installation</b></font><br></div><div>You can install the new version from the <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fppH8_2v8pw3FlshT5bHF\">R-universe</a> or <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/package=poppr\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/package%3Dpoppr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19KQrs3Zn8latv6GYbzE8E\">CRAN</a> via:</div><div><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>options<span>(</span>repos <span>=</span> c<span>(</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>  grunwaldlab <span>=</span> <span>&#39;<a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pKKDXBZoJktCKGQ376R0Q\">https://grunwaldlab.r-universe.dev</a>&#39;</span><span>,</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>  CRAN <span>=</span> <span>&#39;<a href=\"https://cloud.r-project.org\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cloud.r-project.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Goo-TXIJxpQP-ZokodKfI\">https://cloud.r-project.org</a>&#39;</span><span>)</span><span><br></span></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span><span>)</span> <br></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span>\r\ninstall.packages<span>(</span><span>&#39;poppr&#39;</span><span>)</span></span></span></b></div><div><br></div><div>Note: the R-universe is a new platform and will contain the most up-to-date version of poppr in case the one on CRAN gets bumped off.<br><br></div><div><font size=\"5\"><b>What&#39;s New?</b></font></div>This version contains a new function called `bruvo.between()` from David Folarian that compares individuals to a reference set. <br><br>There are also a couple of important bugfixes to genind2genalex() for SNP data and bitwise.ia() for large sample sizes on Windows.<br><br><div>Full details of the release can be seen here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480125486000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1okSr9vw0aNh0eRdm7ObyO\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.9.0</a></div><div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>Zhian N. Kamvar<br></div><br><br><br></blockquote></div>"
